{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/4/544bc89065877919f5e6934021f0492e2320c7ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=\\alpha x^2 +9x+ \\frac{81}{4\\alpha}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"176\" height=\"38\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/3/96371c69b99bc8f58c444aacd446ef6b81a62d0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" />\nWhich of the following is correct, about the graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/2/a5252ea22280556bcb88baad67d87039fe48a622.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\text{intersects x-axis}\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\text{touches y-axis}\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\text{touches x-axis}\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\text{has minimum point}\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\text{has maximum point}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"906\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/8/ab84c54e04e1d49a75dca43dc839d50205108334.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\alpha x^2+9x+\\frac{81}{4\\alpha}=\\left(\\sqrt{\\alpha}x+\\frac{9}{2\\sqrt{\\alpha}}\\right)^2\\]\" width=\"273\" height=\"46\" />\nNotice that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/c/57ccf8d123ba4259e29fba55d9b008874e071492.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> has the unique root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/e/eee6c5fa75644186dc59874826d1d897b654af19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{\\frac{9}{2\\sqrt{\\alpha}}}{\\sqrt{\\alpha}} = \\frac{-9}{2\\alpha}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"98\" height=\"47\" />, so it touches the x-axis, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/8/2484f88154fadcf9c781bba19becdae88696b77f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>From above, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/2/ca2f4283cfd441270cb90bfd2cf89a533f3dde81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> is not correct because the graph does not intersect the x-axis (it is tangent to it).\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/5/fd5cf5dbc8229738cf06adbf2aa73fd75994b058.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" /> is not true; the graph intersects the y-axis since the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Parabola\" title=\"Parabola\">parabola</a> opens up or down.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfbf4df7c25681bb178ddc50ee0c0d656aa25b5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/3/3a3faf1572d785ef1d5d72f120fb3a16190b4b61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" /> depend upon the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/f/10f32377ac67d94f764f12a15ea987e88c85d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" />; if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/e/ade49fc358cadd4f54efd729c4158cb71a401e45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"15\" />, then the parabola has a minimum, and if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/e/ade49fc358cadd4f54efd729c4158cb71a401e45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"15\" /> then the parabola has a maximum.\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/8/2484f88154fadcf9c781bba19becdae88696b77f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_12\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_14\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_15\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_16\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_17\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_18\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_19\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_20\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_21\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_22\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_23\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_24\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_25\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_26\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_27\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_28\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_29\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_30\" title=\"2006 C